{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 0, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "──想要结合，但没有顺利实现的我们。", "text_idx": 304, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 1, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "所以，现在是“还在结合中途”的我们。", "text_idx": 327, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 2, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "周末结束的星期一，天空下起了雨。", "text_idx": 315, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 3, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……啊！”", "text_idx": 257, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 330, "voice": "ar2731", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 4, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "爱理突然发出惊呼。", "text_idx": 332, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 5, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "连忙放下原本伸到嘴边的手指。", "text_idx": 339, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 6, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“怎么了吗？”", "text_idx": 282, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 322, "voice": "ag0562", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 7, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“什么都没有、什什什么都没有！”", "text_idx": 263, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 330, "voice": "ar2732", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 8, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嘴边……哔哔♪安洁知道了～”", "text_idx": 277, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 322, "voice": "ag0563", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 9, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“是想起昨天在路边的那个了吧？呵呼呼～爱理同学真是的～”", "text_idx": 294, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 322, "voice": "ag0564", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 10, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“不、不是的！不是那样！”", "text_idx": 260, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 330, "voice": "ar2733", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 11, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“脸都红了喔～呐～新吾同学，很口爱对吧～”", "text_idx": 295, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 322, "voice": "ag0565", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 12, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“…………”", "text_idx": 256, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 328, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 13, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“新吾同学转身背对了！昨天明明还故意让安洁看的！”", "text_idx": 291, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 322, "voice": "ag0566", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 14, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "……呃，因为爱理会把手放到嘴边，绝对不是因为安洁说的路边接吻的事。", "text_idx": 302, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 33, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 15, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "而是比接吻更厉害的，昨晚的事。", "text_idx": 336, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 16, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "在结合的中途……", "text_idx": 317, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 17, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“总﹑总而言之！！”", "text_idx": 284, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 330, "voice": "ar2734", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 18, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“才讨论到一半而已吧！下周的星期一开始就要期末考试了！”", "text_idx": 290, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 330, "voice": "ar2735", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 19, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“唔唔！一直都故意不去想的说！”", "text_idx": 272, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 322, "voice": "ag0567", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 20, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“呼啊啊爱理同学、爱理同学～请救救安洁，考试要来了～”", "text_idx": 267, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 322, "voice": "ag0568", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 21, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“如果有空哭喊的话就把时间拿来念书。念书的方法之前教过你了吧？”", "text_idx": 280, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 330, "voice": "ar2736", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 22, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“该、该做的事情要确实做好。对吧？新、新吾。”", "text_idx": 296, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 330, "voice": "ar2737", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 23, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“也是啦……”", "text_idx": 262, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 328, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 24, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我红着脸回应爱理。", "text_idx": 326, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 25, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "考试期间真的快到了。", "text_idx": 335, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 26, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“唉，又是考试喔……”", "text_idx": 269, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 334, "voice": "sn0195", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 27, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“感觉不久前才终于考完期中的说～时间一下子就过去了。”", "text_idx": 285, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 340, "voice": "ht0228", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 28, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "今天的天气是雨天，教室内同样也一片愁云惨雾。", "text_idx": 310, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 29, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "临近考试，爱理果然像往常那样认真。", "text_idx": 308, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 30, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“影印这样就好了。接下来是制作进度表然后……（喃喃自语）”", "text_idx": 281, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 330, "voice": "ar2738", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 31, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她非常重视而且积极地做准备，用最佳状态开始用功念书。", "text_idx": 321, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 32, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“谢谢你陪我，新吾。”", "text_idx": 298, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 330, "voice": "ar2739", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 33, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“不会，只是小事，随时都可以。”", "text_idx": 261, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 328, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 34, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“那还可以再一件事吗？我想去福利社买笔记本。”", "text_idx": 300, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 330, "voice": "ar2740", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 35, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……结女的福利社不是很贵吗？”", "text_idx": 259, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 328, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 36, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……是在学校用的。在家里我就用传单的空白背面。”", "text_idx": 258, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 330, "voice": "ar2741", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 37, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“总之……就是这样，走，快点去吧！”", "text_idx": 283, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 330, "voice": "ar2742", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 38, "speaker": "蘭華", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“哎呀，爱理。又跟小新吾在一起啊。”", "text_idx": 268, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "兰华", "alt_speaker_idx": 312, "voice": "rk0217", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 39, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我也有好好念书！还做了读书计划，没有松懈！！”", "text_idx": 286, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 330, "voice": "ar2743", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 40, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "因为对学园长那样说了，所以回到家后她换上便服，立刻开始念书。", "text_idx": 316, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 41, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯嗯……”", "text_idx": 274, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 330, "voice": "ar2744", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 42, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“新吾，如果有不懂的地方就问我喔。”", "text_idx": 293, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 330, "voice": "ar2745", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 43, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯，谢谢你。”", "text_idx": 276, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 328, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 44, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "即使是跟我说话，她的眼神也没有离开手边。", "text_idx": 314, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 45, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "当然我也是为了考试在用功……", "text_idx": 323, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 46, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不过从她的一举一动中可以感受到，年级第一原来是这种感觉啊。", "text_idx": 307, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 47, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“唔……唔唔……快想爱理、快想！不能在这种问题花这么多时间、嗯嗯嗯嗯……”", "text_idx": 270, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 37, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 330, "voice": "ar2746", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 48, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“！”", "text_idx": 301, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 3, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 330, "voice": "ar2747", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 49, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“好……好下一题……再２０页、２０页……！”", "text_idx": 278, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 330, "voice": "ar2748", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 50, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "──呃，或许该说气势多少有点可怕才对，现在的爱理。", "text_idx": 303, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 51, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "为了达成事前订下的读书计划，她正全神贯注地翻动书页。", "text_idx": 309, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 52, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "然后……", "text_idx": 329, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 53, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“今天的进度结束！！”", "text_idx": 264, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 330, "voice": "ar2749", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 54, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "几乎和转到１０点的指针同步达标，她放下自动铅笔。", "text_idx": 313, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 55, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“呼……”", "text_idx": 266, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 330, "voice": "ar2750", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 56, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“好惊人的气势喔……”", "text_idx": 279, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 328, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 57, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "跟我今天念的份量完全不同。当然，吸收的程度也一定不一样吧。", "text_idx": 338, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 58, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我已经决定今天１０点前要念到这个进度了。”", "text_idx": 287, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 330, "voice": "ar2751", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 59, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“决定好的事情就要确实做好。早上也跟安洁这样说过了。”", "text_idx": 265, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 330, "voice": "ar2752", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 60, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“新吾念完了吗？”", "text_idx": 292, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 330, "voice": "ar2753", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 61, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯，多亏了你我的进度也前进很多。……虽然跟爱理的程度不同。”", "text_idx": 275, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 328, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 62, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我跟新吾的目标名次不同嘛。订好时间、集中精神，能达成的话就没有问题了。”", "text_idx": 288, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 37, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 330, "voice": "ar2754", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 63, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“所以，那个……”", "text_idx": 289, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 330, "voice": "ar2755", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 64, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "爱理在我的身旁坐下。", "text_idx": 331, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 65, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她的脸越来越红，手握成拳抵在嘴巴旁边，磨磨蹭蹭的。", "text_idx": 319, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 66, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“该做的事，都确实做好了，那个……新、吾……”", "text_idx": 297, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 330, "voice": "ar2756", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 67, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“唔、嗯……”", "text_idx": 271, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 328, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 68, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她的表情让我心跳加速，我点了点头。", "text_idx": 320, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 69, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "──考试就快到了。", "text_idx": 305, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 70, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "想结合，但是不顺利，所以，还在结合中途的我们。", "text_idx": 324, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 71, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "在震耳欲聋的心跳声中，唇与唇渐渐贴近……", "text_idx": 318, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 72, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“还有一件、要做的事……”", "text_idx": 299, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 330, "voice": "ar2757", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 73, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯……”", "text_idx": 273, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 328, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 74, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "像是被催促般，进行了该做的事情。", "text_idx": 311, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
